usage: k8s-inspector cleanup [-h] [--root ROOT] [--hourly-days HOURLY_DAYS]
                             [--daily-days DAILY_DAYS] [--dry-run]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT           Archive root directory (default ./out/archive)
  --hourly-days HOURLY_DAYS
                        Hourly archive retention days (default 7)
  --daily-days DAILY_DAYS
                        Daily archive retention days (default 30)
  --dry-run             List expired archives without deleting

